# HTTP headers for the deployed site (honored by GitHub Pages).
# Long-lived immutable caching for content-hashed static assets. When an asset's
# content changes, its filename changes too (see public/images), so this safe
# year-long cache never serves a stale screenshot.
# Both patterns are included on purpose: project sites are served under the
# base path (/AestheticOS-Web/), so match it explicitly and without it to cover
# whichever form GitHub matches against. Header lines are indented with 2 spaces.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/AestheticOS-Web/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
